sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / Admin
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Webhook as Webhook Server<br/>9443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Operator as rhods-operator<br/>manager
    participant CompNS as Component Namespace

    Note over User,CompNS: Flow 1: Component Deployment

    User->>K8sAPI: Create/Update DataScienceCluster CR<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: Validate/Mutate DSC<br/>TLS (service-ca)
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Admission Response
    K8sAPI-->>User: CR Created
    K8sAPI->>Operator: Watch event (DSC changed)
    Operator->>Operator: Render kustomize manifests<br/>from /opt/manifests
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create Deployments, Services,<br/>RBAC, CRDs in component NS<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
    K8sAPI->>CompNS: Resources applied

    Note over User,CompNS: Flow 2: Platform Ingress (Gateway API)

    participant ExtUser as External User
    participant Router as OpenShift Router<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Gateway as Gateway (Envoy)<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant AuthProxy as kube-auth-proxy<br/>HTTPS
    participant Backend as Backend Component

    ExtUser->>Router: HTTPS request<br/>TLS 1.2+
    Router->>Gateway: Forward<br/>TLS (Gateway cert)
    Gateway->>AuthProxy: Route via HTTPRoute<br/>TLS (DestinationRule enforced)
    AuthProxy->>K8sAPI: TokenReview<br/>TLS 1.2+ / ServiceAccount
    K8sAPI-->>AuthProxy: Token validated
    AuthProxy->>AuthProxy: OIDC validation
    AuthProxy->>Backend: Forward with Set-Authorization<br/>HTTP(S)
    Backend-->>AuthProxy: Response
    AuthProxy-->>Gateway: Response
    Gateway-->>Router: Response
    Router-->>ExtUser: HTTPS Response

    Note over User,CompNS: Flow 3: Legacy URL Redirect

    participant LegacyUser as External User
    participant LegacyRoute as OpenShift Route<br/>443/TCP HTTPS (edge)
    participant Nginx as nginx redirect<br/>8080/TCP HTTP

    LegacyUser->>LegacyRoute: HTTPS to legacy hostname<br/>TLS (edge)
    LegacyRoute->>Nginx: HTTP/8080
    Nginx-->>LegacyUser: HTTP 301 redirect<br/>to Gateway hostname
